description:
1、团队管理与组织建设：负责TikTok国际商业化市场营销团队的日常管理与能力建设，带领团队制定目标、拆解策略、推动执行与复盘，持续提升团队专业能力与业务影响力；
2、市场策略制定、商机增长与效果优化：围绕TikTok广告商业化业务目标，制定并落地面向重点行业与重点市场的B To B营销策略，统筹品牌认知建设、客户教育、需求激发与业务转化，直接支持收入增长；聚焦New Client Acquisition，联合销售团队搭建新客户获取策略与营销漏斗，提升潜在客服覆盖、线索质量、商机转化与新客贡献，形成可复制的增长打法；建立并持续优化营销效果评估机制，围绕Marketing ROI、MQL、SQL、Pipeline、New Client Acquisition及收入贡献等关键指标进行分析，推动策略和预算持续迭代；
3、To B市场活动规划与牵引：主导行业峰会、品牌活动、闭门会、线上研讨会及整合营销项目的整体规划与执行，能够基于不同市场阶段与客户类型设计活动机制，提升市场触达效率与商机产出；
4、行业洞察与解决方案输出：深入研究电商等重点行业，洞察客户业务挑战、营销诉求与增长机会，沉淀行业解决方案、营销内容与标杆案例，赋能销售团队拓展新客户与重点客户；
5、跨部门协同与资源整合：与销售、产品、运营、数据、区域市场等团队紧密协同，推动复杂项目高效落地，平衡多方诉求并确保关键业务优先级得到执行；
6、目标管理与效果优化：建立并持续优化营销效果评估机制，围绕Marketing ROI、MQL、SQL、Pipeline、New Client Acquisition及收入贡献等关键指标进行分析，推动策略和预算持续迭代。

1.Team Leadership&Capability Building:Lead the day-to-day management and capability development of the international monetization marketing team for TikTok; Set goals, translate strategy into execution, drive reviews, and continuously elevate team effectiveness and business impact;
2.Marketing Strategy,Pipeline Growth&Performance Optimization:Develop and execute B To B marketing strategies aligned with TikTok's advertising monetization priorities across key industries and markets;Drive advertiser education, demand generation, and business conversion to support revenue growth;Focus on New Client Acquisition by partnering closely with Sales to build scalable acquisition strategies and marketing funnels;Improve prospect reach, lead quality, opportunity conversion, and new-client contribution;Establish and continuously refine marketing measurement frameworks;Analyze key metrics including Marketing ROI,MQL,SQL,Pipeline,New Client Acquisition, and revenue contribution to optimize strategy and budget allocation;
3.To B Event Strategy&Execution:Lead the planning and execution of major B To B marketing initiatives, including industry summits, flagship events, executive roundtables, webinars, and integrated campaigns;Design event programs based on market maturity and customer segments to maximize engagement and pipeline impact;
4.Industry Insights&Solution Development:Conduct in-depth research on priority verticals such as E-commerce,identify customer pain points and growth opportunities,and develop industry narratives,content assets,and success stories that support new business development;
5.Cross-functional Leadership&Resource Integration:Collaborate closely with Sales, Product, Operations, Data, and Regional Marketing teams to drive complex initiatives, align stakeholders, and ensure business priorities are effectively executed;
6.Build and continuously refine marketing performance evaluation framework; analyze core KPIs including Marketing ROI, MQL, SQL, sales pipeline, new client acquisition and revenue contribution to drive iterative optimization of marketing strategies and budget allocation.

requirements:
1、拥有5年及以上B To B市场营销相关经验，具备互联网平台、数字广告、SaaS、企业服务或相关商业化场景经验；有国际化业务或出海市场经验者优先；
2、团队管理经验：具备成熟的团队管理经验，能够带领团队完成目标制定、人才培养、任务分配与绩效管理，推动团队在复杂业务环境中稳定输出结果；
3、To B活动能力：具备丰富的To B市场活动经验，能够独立主导从策略、策划、执行到复盘的全流程工作，并对活动带来的商机增长与业务转化有清晰的方法论和实战成果；
4、新开获客能力与商业理解：在New Client Acquisition、Demand Generation、Lead Generation等方面有扎实经验，能够与销售协同制定新客增长策略，并通过内容、活动、渠道和运营组合驱动新增客户获取；对广告商业化模式及企业客户决策链路有深入认知，能够从业务目标出发制定市场策略，并在行业、客户、产品和销售之间建立有效连接；
5、跨部门协作与项目管理：具备出色的跨团队沟通与复杂项目管理能力，能够统筹多方资源、推动关键事项落地，并在不确定环境中做出判断与取舍；
6、数据驱动能力与语言能力：具备很强的数据分析能力与业务敏感度；英语可作为主要工作语言，具备流利的听说读写能力，能够独立与海外团队、合作伙伴及客户沟通。

1.A minimum of five years of relevant B To B marketing experience, with practical experience in internet platforms, digital advertising, SaaS, enterprise services or related commercialization fields; candidates with international or overseas go-to-market experience are preferred;
2.Possess mature team management experience, capable of leading the team in goal formulation, talent development, task assignment and performance management, and enabling steady business output of the team amid complex business scenarios;
3.Boast abundant experience in B2B marketing events, able to independently oversee full-cycle work from strategy, planning and execution to post-review, and own mature methodologies and proven practical results in boosting business opportunities and conversion driven by campaigns;
4.Have solid experience in New Client Acquisition, Demand Generation and Lead Generation, able to jointly formulate new customer growth strategies with sales teams and fuel new customer expansion through integrated content, event, channel and operational approaches; maintain in-depth understanding of ad; commercialization models and enterprise customer decision journey, capable of developing market strategies based on business targets and establishing effective connections among industries, clients, products and sales;
5.Feature outstanding cross-team communication and complex project management capabilities, able to coordinate multi-party resources, accelerate the implementation of core priorities and make rational judgments and trade-offs amid uncertain environments；
6.Own robust data analysis capability and acute business insight, with fluent English listening, speaking, reading and writing to use English as primary working language and communicate independently with overseas teams, partners and clients.

description:
1、负责Lark国际增长营销内容的策划与创作，内容涵盖官网、社交媒体及其他线上渠道；
2、搭建并维护Lark产品营销内容库，系统化梳理产品卖点、客户痛点与价值主张，构建可复用的内容资产体系；
3、基于用户旅程与市场阶段（认知–考虑–转化），结合各地区文化语境与渠道特性，制定内容叙事策略，确保品牌价值精准传递；
4、与产品、售前、客户成功及市场团队紧密协作，将产品价值与客户成功案例转化为具有情感共鸣与商业影响力的品牌故事；
5、利用数据洞察（包括但不限于CTR、CVR、观看时长、线索转化等）评估内容表现，不断优化策略与创意方向，驱动用户增长与品牌影响力提升。

1.Responsible for planning and generating marketing content for Lark's overseas growth, covering official websites, social media, and other online channels;
2.Build and maintain Lark's product marketing content library, systematically organizing product selling points, customer pain points, and value propositions to establish a reusable content asset system;
3.Develop content narrative strategies based on the user journey and market stages (awareness, consideration, conversion), incorporating regional cultural contexts and channel characteristics to ensure accurate delivery of brand value;
4.Collaborate closely with product, pre-sales, customer success, and marketing teams to transform product value and customer success stories into brand narratives that evoke emotional resonance and business impact;
5.Utilize data insights (including but not limited to CTR, CVR, watch time, lead conversion, etc.) to evaluate content performance, continuously optimize strategies and creative directions, and drive user growth and brand influence.

requirements:
1、英文口语流利，书面表达需达到出版级（Publication-grade），文案措辞自然、富有感染力，能够深入理解并熟练运用英语文化语境下的细微差别（Cultural Nuances）；精通中文，可灵活适配跨文化沟通的表达差异；
2、具备出色的英文写作、编辑与内容策划能力，能将复杂概念转化为清晰、有吸引力的表达；
3、2年以上B2B、SaaS或企业服务类内容策划、市场营销或增长相关经验；
4、具备优秀的跨部门协作与项目管理能力，能够高效推动多团队、多地区项目落地；
5、具备数据驱动思维，能基于内容表现数据优化策略，提升整体营销效果。

1.Fluent in spoken English with publication-grade writing skills, capable of crafting compelling and culturally nuanced content. Expert in Chinese and cross-cultural communication, ensuring clarity and impact for diverse global audiences;
2.Excellent English writing, editing, and content planning skills, capable of translating complex concepts into clear and engaging expressions;
3.At least 2 years of experience in B2B, SaaS, or enterprise services-related content planning, marketing, or growth roles;
4.Strong cross-departmental collaboration and project management skills, with the ability to efficiently drive the implementation of multi-team and multi-region projects;
5.Data-driven mindset, capable of optimizing strategies based on content performance data to enhance overall marketing effectiveness.

description:
1、渠道准入与资质审核（Entrance Management）：
1）负责制定、优化及推行SaaS渠道商、合作伙伴的准入标准与评估模型（包含企业资质、技术能力、商务潜力、合规风险等多维度）；
2）承接新渠道商的入驻申请，组织跨部门（法务、财务、销售、技术）评审，确保新引入的伙伴符合公司战略发展方向；
3）优化准入流程，提升渠道商双向入驻体验，缩短签约周期；
2、渠道商人员认证与赋能追踪（Enablement&Tracking）：
1）协同赋能、培训团队，建立渠道商从业人员（销售、Pre-sales、交付实施、客服）的认证考核体系；
2）负责渠道人员认证数据的全量统计、漏斗分析与动态Tracking，定期产出各区域、各级别渠道商的人才成熟度报告；
3）监督并推动渠道商达成人员持证率指标，对未达标伙伴进行预警、督导与定向帮扶；
3、渠道绩效考核与动态准出（Performance&Exit Management）：
1）负责组织实施渠道商的月度、季度、年度绩效考核（KPI/OKR）、激励核算和沟通，不仅关注业绩，更关注客户续费率（NDR）、交付满意度等SaaS核心指标；
2）制定明确的渠道降级与准出（汰换）机制；针对长期不达标、严重违规（如洗单、飞单、价格乱象）的渠道商，执行警告、降级、冻结或解约流转，维护生态健康度；
4、渠道数据资产与系统运营（Data&Systems）：
1）负责PRM（合作伙伴关系管理系统）或CRM系统中渠道模块的维护，确保准入、认证、考核、准出等全链路数据的准确性与实时性；
2）基于数据分析，发现渠道管理流程中的痛点，沉淀运营标准SOP，实现渠道管理的数字化与工具化；
5、渠道交易运营支持与流程优化（Deal Support&Process Improvement）：
1）支持渠道团队从销售机会到现金回款的关键交易流程，包括报价、合同、订单、激活等环节，提升销售推进效率；
2）确保报价、订单、发票等系统数据准确合规，为销售团队提供日常支持、问题排查及流程指引；
3）协同运营、财务、法务、税务和系统团队，分析复杂交易场景并持续优化工具、模板、流程与SLA，沉淀最佳实践并开展相关培训。

1.Entrance Management:
1)Develop, optimize, and implement access standards and evaluation models for SaaS channel partners/vendors(covering multi-dimensional criteria including corporate qualifications, technical capabilities, business potential, and compliance risks);
2)Manage new channel partner onboarding applications, organizing cross-departmental reviews(Legal,Finance,Sales,Technology)to ensure new partners align with the company's strategic direction;
3)Optimize the access process to improve the two-way onboarding experience for channel partners and shorten contract signing cycles;
2.Enablement&Tracking:
1)Collaborate with the Enablement/training team to establish a certification and assessment system for channel partner staff(Sales,Pre-sales,Delivery/Implementation,Customer Support);
2)Oversee comprehensive statistics, funnel analysis, and dynamic tracking of channel personnel certification Data, regularly producing talent maturity reports by region and partner tier;
3)Monitor and drive partners to meet staff certification rate targets, issuing early warnings, providing guidance, and offering targeted support to underperforming partners;
3.Performance&Exit Management:
1)Organize and execute monthly/quarterly/annual performance assessments(KPI/OKR)and incentive calculations for channel partners, with a focus not only on revenue but also on core SaaS metrics such as Net Dollar Retention(NDR)and delivery satisfaction;
2)Establish clear mechanisms for partner downgrades and exits(phase-out);Enforce warnings, downgrades, suspensions, or contract terminations for partners that consistently underperform or engage in serious violations(e.g.,order manipulation, sales poaching, pricing irregularities)to maintain ecosystem health;
4.Data&Systems:
1)Maintain channel modules within the PRM(Partner Relationship Management)or CRM system, ensuring accuracy and real-time Data integrity across the entire lifecycle—from access and certification to performance reviews and exits;
2)Leverage Data analysis to identify pain points in channel management processes, standardize operational SOPs, and drive the digitization and tool-based evolution of channel management;
5.Deal Support&Process Improvement
1)Support the channel team through critical transaction processes from sales opportunity to cash collection, including quoting, contracting, order processing, and activation, to enhance sales efficiency;
2)Ensure accuracy and compliance of system Data related to quotes, orders, and invoices, while providing day-to-day support, Troubleshooting, and process guidance to the sales team;
3)Collaborate with Operations, Finance, Legal, Tax, and Systems teams to analyze complex transaction scenarios, continuously optimize tools, templates, processes, and SLAs, and distill best practices through relevant training initiatives.

requirements:
1、本科及以上学历，计算机、信息管理、市场营销或工商管理等相关专业优先；
2、工作经验：2-5年及以上商业运营相关工作经验，其中至少2年SaaS或To B IT厂商销售运营经验；
3、专业能力：
1）熟悉SaaS行业的渠道生态模式（代理、咨询、交付、ISV等）；
2）具备流程建设能力与数据敏感度，能够熟练使用Excel、BI工具或PRM系统进行复杂数据分析；
3）具备较强的执行力，面对多任务时能分清优先级；
4）英语能作为工作语言；有跨地区/时区工作经验者更佳；
4、软性技能：
1）原则性强：在准入准出与合规管理上坚持原则，具备优秀的风险识别与防范意识；
2）跨部门沟通：优秀的沟通协调与冲突解决能力，能够推动销售线、产品线、法务等多方高效协同；
3）对AI工具有浓厚兴趣和实操经验，具备快速学习新事物、新技术并将其转化为生产力的能力，能够主动思考如何利用新工具优化销售效能；
4）具备自驱力，能够适应快速变化的组织环境。

1.Education:Bachelor's degree or above; majors in Computer Science,Information Management,Marketing,Business Administration, or related fields preferred;
2.Experience:2–5 years of working experience in commercial operations or above ,with at least2years in sales operations at a SaaS or B2B IT vendor;
3.Professional Competencies:
1)Familiarity with channel ecosystem models in the SaaS industry(e.g.,agency, consulting, delivery, ISV);
2)Strong process-building capabilities和Data sensitivity, with proficiency in Excel,BI tools, or PRM systems for complex data analysis;
3)Strong execution Skills with the ability to prioritize effectively across multiple tasks;
4)English proficiency as a working language; experience working across regions/time zones is a plus;
4.Soft Skills:
1)Strong sense of integrity:Upholds principles in access, exit, and compliance management, with excellent risk identification and prevention awareness;
2)Cross-functional communication:Outstanding communication, coordination,和conflict-resolution Skills, capable of driving efficient collaboration across sales, product, legal, and other teams;
3)AI enthusiasm&adaptability:Genuine interest and hands-on experience with AI tools; ability to quickly learn new technologies和convert them into productivity gains, proactively identifying ways to leverage new tools to optimize sales effectiveness;
4)Resilience&self-motivation:adapt to a rapidly changing organizational environment.

